<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title> {% block title %}Login - KasirPro{% endblock %}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Masuk ke sistem KasirPro - Solusi kasir modern untuk bisnis Anda">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/bootstrap/5.3.0/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='css/login.css') }}">
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='favicon.ico') }}">
</head>
<body>

    {% with messages = get_flashed_messages(with_categories=true) %}
        {% if messages %}
            {% for category, message in messages %}
                <div class="alert alert-{{ category }} alert-dismissible fade show position-fixed top-0 start-50 translate-middle-x mt-3"
                     role="alert" style="z-index: 9999; min-width: 350px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-{% if category == 'success' %}check-circle{% elif category == 'danger' %}exclamation-circle{% elif category == 'warning' %}exclamation-triangle{% else %}info-circle{% endif %} me-2"></i>
                    <strong>{{ message }}</strong>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endwith %}

    <div class="login-container">
        <div class="login-left">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <span class="logo">KP</span>
                <div class="logo-text">KasirPro</div>
            </div>
            <div class="left-content">
                <h1>Solusi Kasir Modern untuk Bisnis Anda</h1>
                <p>Kelola transaksi, inventaris, dan laporan keuangan dengan mudah menggunakan sistem kasir terintegrasi.</p>
                <ul class="features">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i><span>Transaksi cepat dan akurat</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i><span>Laporan real-time</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i><span>Akses dari perangkat apapun</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i><span>Keamanan data terjamin</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="login-right">
            <div class="login-header">
                <h2>Login ke KasirPro</h2>
                <p>Masukkan kredensial Anda untuk mengakses dashboard</p>
            </div>

            <form id="loginForm" method="POST" action="{{ url_for('auth.login') }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{ session.csrf_token }}">

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="username">Username atau Email</label>
                    <div class="input-with-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="username" name="username" class="form-control"
                               placeholder="contoh:santaiaja123@gmail.com" required autocomplete="username">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password</label>
                    <div class="input-with-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
                        <input type="password" id="password" name="password" class="form-control"
                               placeholder="Secure!45Password" required autocomplete="current-password">
                        <button type="button" class="password-toggle" id="togglePassword">
                            <i class="fas fa-eye"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="remember-forgot">
                    <div class="remember">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="remember" name="remember">
                        <label for="remember">Ingat saya</label>
                    </div>
                    <a href="{{ url_for('auth.forgot_password') }}" class="forgot-password">Lupa password?</a>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="login-btn" id="loginButton">
                    <span id="buttonText">Masuk ke Sistem</span>
                </button>

                <div class="register-link">
                    <p>Belum punya akun? <a href="{{ url_for('auth.register') }}">Daftar sekarang</a></p>
                </div>
            </form>

            <div class="footer">
                <span>Pengguna bertanggung jawab atas keamanan akun dan segala aktivitasnya.
                Kerugian akibat kelalaian bukan tanggung jawab kami.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.6.0/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/bootstrap/5.3.0/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='js/login.js') }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
